<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#04223f" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
<title>Salaam — Jadwal Sholat &amp; Kompas Kiblat</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🕌</text></svg>" />
<style>
  :root{
    --teal:#3cb4b4;
    --teal-lt:#54ccb4;
    --teal-dk:#0f7a6f;
    --blue-dk:#04223f;
    --blue:#0a4d7a;
    --blue-lt:#0f7bb0;
    --ink:#0b1b2b;
    --muted:#6b7c8f;
    --line:#e6eef5;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  html,body{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    height:100dvh;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    overscroll-behavior:none;
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
  }
  body{
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
    color:#fff;
    background:#fff;
    user-select:none;
  }
  .app{
    width:100%;
    max-width:480px;
    height:100%;
    height:100dvh;
    margin:0 auto;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    overflow:hidden;
    position:relative;
  }
  main{
    flex:1;
    min-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    position:relative;
  }
  .screen{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .screen[hidden]{display:none}

  /* ================= BERANDA / SHOLAT ================= */
  .screen--sky{
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg,#03203c 0%, #063c63 14%, #0a5b8a 30%, #3f92bb 46%,
                      #a9d3e6 60%, #e7f3f9 72%, #ffffff 82%, #ffffff 100%);
  }
  .hero{padding:14px 20px 0;flex-shrink:0}
  .date-block{text-align:right}
  .greg{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:600;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);letter-spacing:.01em}
  .hijri{font-size:.98rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-top:3px;text-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
  .np{margin-top:12px;text-align:left}
  .np-label{
    font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  }
  .np-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;margin-top:2px}
  .np-time{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5dvh,2.7rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1;color:#fff;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
    text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}
  .np-remain{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700;color:#cdeeff;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}

  /* gambar Masjidil Haram di tengah beranda */
  .haram{
    position:relative;margin:14px 20px 0;flex:1;min-height:100px;max-height:280px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 16px 34px rgba(4,34,63,.30);background:#0a3a5c;
  }
  .haram img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 42%;display:block}
  .haram::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(3,32,60,.06) 0%,rgba(3,32,60,0) 42%,rgba(3,32,60,.55) 100%);
  }
  .haram figcaption{
    position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:10px;z-index:2;
    font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.10em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.94);text-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.65);
  }

  .grid-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:16px 20px 0;flex-shrink:0}
  .grid-head h2{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0b3c5d;margin:0}
  .city-link{
    border:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font:inherit;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;color:#0b3c5d;
    padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,60,93,.10);
    max-width:60%;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .pgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;padding:10px 16px 0;flex-shrink:0}
  .pcard{
    background:#fff;border:1px solid #e4eef6;border-radius:16px;padding:10px 8px 9px;
    text-align:center;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(11,64,98,.10);
    transition:transform .15s;
  }
  .pcard .n{font-size:.63rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7f95a8}
  .pcard .t{font-size:1.06rem;font-weight:800;color:#0b3c5d;margin-top:4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .pcard .b{display:block;font-size:.55rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-dk);margin-top:3px;min-height:.7em}
  .pcard.active{
    background:linear-gradient(140deg,#1186bb,#0a4d7a);border-color:transparent;
    box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(10,77,122,.34);transform:translateY(-2px);
  }
  .pcard.active .n{color:#bfe9ff}
  .pcard.active .t{color:#fff}
  .pcard.active .b{color:#bfe9ff}

  .src{padding:10px 20px 10px;margin:0;font-size:.66rem;line-height:1.4;color:#5d7c92;flex-shrink:0}
  .src b{color:#0b3c5d}

  /* ================= KIBLAT ================= */
  .screen--dark{
    background:
      radial-gradient(85% 38% at 50% 44%, rgba(4,69,127,.95) 0%, rgba(4,40,74,.55) 48%, transparent 72%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,#050f17 0%, #06182a 24%, #04284a 58%, #050f17 100%);
  }
  #scrKiblat{position:relative;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:0}
  .qibla-head{
    position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:3;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 20px 2px;
  }
  .qibla-title{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9fc4d8}
  .qibla-city{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:#cdeeff;max-width:55%;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}

  .compass-wrap{
    position:relative;width:min(80vw,46dvh,340px);aspect-ratio:1/1;margin:0 auto;
    touch-action:none;cursor:grab;
  }
  .compass-wrap:active{cursor:grabbing}
  .compass-wrap::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:-9%;border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(84,204,180,.20) 0%,rgba(3,69,127,.10) 45%,transparent 68%);
    transition:background .35s;
  }
  .compass-wrap.aligned::before{
    background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(84,204,180,.42) 0%,rgba(60,180,180,.16) 48%,transparent 70%);
  }
  .dial{position:absolute;inset:0;will-change:transform;filter:drop-shadow(0 16px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.45))}
  .needle{position:absolute;inset:0;will-change:transform;pointer-events:none;z-index:2}
  .needle svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
  .compass-wrap.aligned .needle{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(84,204,180,.9))}
  .hub{
    position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:13%;height:13%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 28%,#ffffff,#cfe9e6 42%,#3f8f8b);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(5,15,23,.55),0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.9rem;z-index:2;
  }
  .compass-logo{
    position:absolute;left:50%;top:60.5%;transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:34%;height:auto;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;
    display:block;object-fit:contain;
  }
  .fixed-mark{
    position:absolute;left:50%;top:-6px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:0;height:0;
    border-left:8px solid transparent;border-right:8px solid transparent;
    border-top:13px solid var(--teal-lt);filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.6));z-index:3;
  }
  .qibla-read{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:9px;margin-top:10px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .qibla-read b{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
  .qibla-read span{font-size:.8rem;color:#9fc4d8}
  .verdict{
    position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
    bottom:16px;
    text-align:center;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.5;color:#c8dbe8;
    padding:0 26px;min-height:2.4em;width:100%;max-width:370px;
  }
  .verdict b{color:var(--teal-lt)}

  /* ================= PENGATURAN ================= */
  .screen--light{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:0 0 8px;justify-content:space-between}
  .set-wrap{padding:12px 18px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex:1;min-height:0}
  .set-wrap h1{margin:0;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink)}
  .set-wrap .sub{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .card{
    background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;
    margin-top:0;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,60,93,.06);
  }
  .card h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  select{
    width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:.82rem;padding:7px 32px 7px 10px;border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid #dbe6ee;background:#f7fafc;color:var(--ink);margin-top:6px;
    appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;cursor:pointer;
    background-image:linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 50%,#7f96ab 50%),linear-gradient(135deg,#7f96ab 50%,transparent 50%);
    background-position:calc(100% - 18px) 50%,calc(100% - 13px) 50%;
    background-size:5px 5px,5px 5px;background-repeat:no-repeat;
  }
  select:disabled{opacity:.5}
  .btn{
    width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:6px;
    padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #dbe6ee;background:#f5f9fc;color:#26445f;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .btn:active{transform:scale(.99)}
  .btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal-lt),var(--teal));border-color:transparent;color:#053b39}
  .hint{font-size:.65rem;line-height:1.35;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}
  .kv{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:.74rem;color:#3d4f66;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .kv:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .kv span:last-child{font-weight:700;color:#16324a;text-align:right}
  .about{font-size:.62rem;line-height:1.35;color:var(--muted);padding:4px 18px 0;margin:0}

  /* ================= NAV ================= */
  .nav{
    flex-shrink:0;
    width:100%;max-width:480px;z-index:20;
    display:flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:8px 6px calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  }
  .nav button{
    flex:1;border:0;background:none;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;
    font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;color:#8a99a8;padding:2px 0;
  }
  .nav button .ico{font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1;filter:grayscale(1);opacity:.6;transition:.2s}
  .nav button.active{color:var(--blue-lt)}
  .nav button.active .ico{filter:none;opacity:1;transform:translateY(-1px)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <main>
    <!-- ================= BERANDA: SHOLAT ================= -->
    <section class="screen screen--sky" id="scrSholat">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="date-block">
          <div class="greg" id="gregDate">—</div>
          <div class="hijri" id="hijriDate">—</div>
        </div>

        <div class="np">
          <div class="np-label" data-cd-label>Menunggu jadwal</div>
          <div class="np-row">
            <span class="np-time" data-cd-time>--:--</span>
            <span class="np-remain" data-cd-remain>--:--:--</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="haram">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Masjidil Haram, Makkah" />
        <figcaption>Masjidil Haram · Makkah</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="grid-head">
        <h2>Jadwal Sholat</h2>
        <button class="city-link" id="cityLink">Pilih lokasi</button>
      </div>

      <div class="pgrid" id="prayerGrid"></div>

      <p class="src" id="jadwalNote">Sumber jadwal: <b>Kemenag</b> (api.myquran.com)</p>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= KIBLAT ================= -->
    <section class="screen screen--dark" id="scrKiblat" hidden>
      <div class="qibla-head">
        <span class="qibla-title">Arah Kiblat</span>
        <span class="qibla-city" id="cityKiblat">—</span>
      </div>

      <div class="compass-wrap" id="wrap">
        <div class="fixed-mark"></div>
        <div class="dial" id="dial"></div>
        <img class="compass-logo" src="{{ asset('theme/static/diskominfotiksan-logo-small.webp') }}" alt="Diskominfotiksan Kota Pekanbaru" />
        <div class="needle" id="needle"></div>
        <div class="hub">🕋</div>
      </div>

      <div class="qibla-read">
        <b id="bearingVal">—</b>
        <span id="bearingDir">Pilih lokasi dulu</span>
      </div>

      <div class="verdict" id="verdict">Sentuh kompas untuk mengaktifkan sensor, atau seret untuk mengarahkan manual.</div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= PENGATURAN ================= -->
    <section class="screen screen--light" id="scrPengaturan" hidden>
      <div class="set-wrap">
        <h1>Pengaturan</h1>
        <p class="sub">Lokasi, sensor, dan status perangkat</p>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Lokasi</h3>
          <select id="provSelect" aria-label="Provinsi"></select>
          <select id="citySelect" aria-label="Kabupaten atau Kota" disabled></select>
          <button class="btn primary" id="btnGps">📍 Lokasi Saya</button>
          <p class="hint">Pilih provinsi lalu kabupaten/kota secara manual, atau tekan <b>Lokasi Saya</b> untuk memakai GPS perangkat.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Kompas</h3>
          <button class="btn" id="btnSensor2">🧭 Aktifkan Sensor Kompas</button>
          <p class="hint">iPhone/iPad akan meminta izin gerak. Kalibrasi dengan menggerakkan ponsel membentuk angka 8.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Status</h3>
          <div class="kv"><span>Lokasi</span><span id="kvCity">—</span></div>
          <div class="kv"><span>Koordinat</span><span id="kvCoord">—</span></div>
          <div class="kv"><span>Jarak ke Makkah</span><span id="kvDist">—</span></div>
          <div class="kv"><span>Arah kiblat</span><span id="kvQibla">—</span></div>
          <div class="kv"><span>Akurasi sensor</span><span id="kvAcc">—</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="about">
        Arah kiblat dihitung dengan rumus <i>great-circle bearing</i> dari koordinat Anda ke Ka'bah
        (21,4225° LU / 39,8262° BT). Jadwal sholat bersumber dari API Kemenag melalui api.myquran.com
        dan disimpan di perangkat agar tetap terbaca saat offline. Arah kompas mengikuti utara magnetik;
        deklinasi di Indonesia kecil (&lt; 2°).
      </p>
      <p class="about" style="padding-top:6px">
        Foto Masjidil Haram: <b>Saudipics.com</b> — CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <nav class="nav">
    <button data-tab="sholat" class="active"><span class="ico">🕌</span>Sholat</button>
    <button data-tab="kiblat"><span class="ico">🧭</span>Kiblat</button>
    <button data-tab="pengaturan"><span class="ico">⚙️</span>Pengaturan</button>
  </nav>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  "use strict";

